The methodology for determining and updating the water efficiency indicator(s) shall be maintained as documented information and regularly reviewed. Water efficiency indicator(s) shall be reviewed and compared with the baseline water efficiency indicator(s) as appropriate and periodically updated as appropriate.', 'derived', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
