SELECT w.id, (SELECT ws.id FROM worksheet_sections ws WHERE ws.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND ws.code = 'F'), 'baseline_adjustment_note', 'Neu festgelegte Baseline: Begründung und neuer Wert (§6.2.7 a) – c) — nur bei gesetztem Anpassungsauslöser)', 'text', NULL, false, '§6.2.7', 'Plan 3: Freitext, nur sichtbar bei gesetztem baseline_adjustment_trigger („Adjustments to the baseline(s) shall be made in the case of one or more of the following“); der Auslöser als Mehrfachauswahl ist STAGED (iso46001-S-1); CR-018 liest weiterhin baseline_water_efficiency_indicator.', 'imported_unverified', '6.2.7 Identify baseline water efficiency indicator(s)
The organization shall identify baseline water efficiency indicator(s) appropriate for monitoring and measuring its water efficiency programme achievements. Changes in water efficiency performance shall be measured against the baseline water efficiency indicator(s).
Adjustments to the baseline(s) shall be made in the case of one or more of the following:
a) the specific business activity indicator(s) no longer reflect organizational water use;
b) there have been changes to the process, operational patterns or water systems;
c) variation from predetermined and documented methods.
The organization shall retain documented information on its baseline water efficiency indicator(s).', 'scalar', NULL, NULL, 'baseline_adjustment_trigger IS NOT NULL', NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
FROM worksheet_templates w JOIN standards s ON s.id = w.standard_id WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM fields f2 WHERE f2.worksheet_template_id = w.id AND f2.symbol = 'baseline_adjustment_note') AND w.code = 'ISO-46001-04' AND s.code = 'ISO-46001';
