The organization shall establish, within or supplemental to the objectives, water efficiency targets at relevant functions, levels, processes or facilities within the organization.
Time frames shall be established for achievement of the targets.', 'derived', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
