where

Win is total water input; Wout is total water output. Should total water input exceed total water output, the difference could be due to leaks and uncontrolled losses.', 'derived', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
